ame.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1769270/extras/e6788871fbd83ba621cba4a716c02af9.poster.avif?t=1740086037\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1769270/extras/e6788871fbd83ba621cba4a716c02af9.webm?t=1740086037\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1769270/extras/e6788871fbd83ba621cba4a716c02af9.mp4?t=1740086037\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rise to the top ! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Become the best volleyball club of the world.</p>",
